-- ccc9-tests-sexual-evidence.l4 -- tests for ss 276 to 277. Expected values are written by hand from the text (line numbers of the text file where cited).
-- Fixture for the seam input s 787(1) (text line 16717): a fine of not more than $5,000 or imprisonment of not more than two years less a day, or both.
`s 276 test: the s 787(1) general penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`), `no imprisonment is stated`, (`a fine of` 5000), `no fine is stated`

