§ `s 276.03: the publication ban`

-- Field order of `s 276.03(1.1) facts`: in the course of the administration of justice, purpose not to make it known in the community, made by the complainant or a witness, about their own particulars, without revealing another protected person, purpose not to make it known to the public, made to a legal professional or health care professional or person in a relationship of trust
`s 276.03(1.1) test: administration of justice` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 276.03(1.1) test: administration of justice, but made known in the community` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant about themselves` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant about themselves but revealing another protected person` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 276.03(1.1) test: a stranger about the complainant` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 276.03(1.1) test: a witness, not to the public` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant to a lawyer` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant to the public` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 276.03(1.1) test: a stranger to a lawyer` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`s 276.03(1.1) test: nothing applies` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1)(a) the disclosure is made in the course of the administration of justice when its purpose is not to make the information known in the community` `s 276.03(1.1) test: administration of justice`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 276.03(1.1)(a) the disclosure is made in the course of the administration of justice when its purpose is not to make the information known in the community` `s 276.03(1.1) test: administration of justice, but made known in the community`)
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1)(b) the disclosure is made by the complainant or a witness about themselves, without revealing another protected person` `s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant about themselves`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 276.03(1.1)(b) the disclosure is made by the complainant or a witness about themselves, without revealing another protected person` `s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant about themselves but revealing another protected person`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 276.03(1.1)(b) the disclosure is made by the complainant or a witness about themselves, without revealing another protected person` `s 276.03(1.1) test: a stranger about the complainant`)
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1)(c) the disclosure is made by the complainant or a witness when its purpose is not to make the information known to the public` `s 276.03(1.1) test: a witness, not to the public`
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1)(c) the disclosure is made by the complainant or a witness when its purpose is not to make the information known to the public` `s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant to a lawyer`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 276.03(1.1)(c) the disclosure is made by the complainant or a witness when its purpose is not to make the information known to the public` `s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant to the public`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 276.03(1.1)(c) the disclosure is made by the complainant or a witness when its purpose is not to make the information known to the public` `s 276.03(1.1) test: a stranger to a lawyer`)
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1) subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure` `s 276.03(1.1) test: administration of justice` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1) subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure` `s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant about themselves` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1) subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure` `s 276.03(1.1) test: a witness, not to the public` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1) subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure` `s 276.03(1.1) test: the complainant to a lawyer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1) subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure` `s 276.03(1.1) test: a stranger about the complainant` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 276.03(1.1) subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure` `s 276.03(1.1) test: nothing applies` EQUALS JUST FALSE

